export function TicketFields({form,setForm}:{form:Values;setForm:Dispatch<SetStateAction<Values>>}){const id=useId();function set<K extends keyof Values>(key:K,value:Values[K]){setForm(previous=>updateValue(previous,key,value));}return <><label htmlFor={`${id}-priority`}>Priorytet</label><select id={`${id}-priority`} name="priority" value={form.priority} onChange={event=>{const value=event.currentTarget.value;if(isPriority(value))set("priority",value);}}>{PRIORITIES.map(value=><option key={value} value={value}>{value}</option>)}</select><label htmlFor={`${id}-assignee`}>Osoba</label><select id={`${id}-assignee`} name="assignee" value={form.assignee??""} onChange={event=>{const value=parseAssignee(event.currentTarget.value);if(value!==undefined)set("assignee",value);}}><option value="">— nikt —</option>{PEOPLE.map(person=><option key={person} value={person}>{person}</option>)}</select><fieldset><legend>Typ zgłoszenia</legend>{KINDS.map(kind=><label key={kind}><input type="radio" name={`${id}-kind`} value={kind} checked={form.kind===kind} onChange={()=>set("kind",kind)}/>{kind}</label>)}</fieldset><label><input type="checkbox" name="fromCustomer" checked={form.fromCustomer} onChange={event=>set("fromCustomer",event.currentTarget.checked)}/>Zgłoszenie klienta</label><fieldset><legend>Tagi</legend>{TAGS.map(tag=><label key={tag}><input type="checkbox" name="tags" value={tag} checked={form.tags.includes(tag)} onChange={()=>setForm(previous=>toggleTag(previous,tag))}/>{tag}</label>)}</fieldset><label htmlFor={`${id}-estimate`}>Szacowany czas (h)</label><input id={`${id}-estimate`} name="estimateHours" type="number" min={0} step={0.5} value={form.estimateHours} onChange={event=>{const value=parseEstimate(event.currentTarget.value);if(value!==null)set("estimateHours",value);}}/><label htmlFor={`${id}-date`}>Termin</label><input id={`${id}-date`} name="dueDate" type="date" value={form.dueDate} onChange={event=>set("dueDate",event.currentTarget.value)}/></>;}
export function FullTicketForm({onCreate}:{onCreate:(values:TicketDraft)=>void}){const [form,setForm]=useState<Values>(emptyValues);const id=useId();return <form onSubmit={event=>{event.preventDefault();if(!form.title.trim()||!validEstimate(form.estimateHours))return;onCreate(toDraft(form));setForm(emptyValues());}}><label htmlFor={`${id}-title`}>Tytuł</label><input id={`${id}-title`} name="title" value={form.title} required onChange={event=>{const value=event.currentTarget.value;setForm(previous=>updateValue(previous,"title",value));}}/><label htmlFor={`${id}-description`}>Opis</label><textarea id={`${id}-description`} name="description" rows={4} value={form.description} onChange={event=>{const value=event.currentTarget.value;setForm(previous=>updateValue(previous,"description",value));}}/><TicketFields form={form} setForm={setForm}/><button type="submit">Utwórz ticket</button></form>;}

